  "parentName": "Dickson.sylow_le_normal_of_coprime_index",
  "oldText":
  "exact QuotientGroup.ker_mk' N ▸ MonoidHom.mem_ker.mpr (congr_arg Subtype.val <| match h_sub with\n      | ⟨h_allEq⟩ => h_allEq (⟨QuotientGroup.mk' N x,\n          Subgroup.mem_map_of_mem _ hx⟩ : ↥(P.map (QuotientGroup.mk' N))) 1)",
