  "message":
  "Try these:\n  [apply] grind only [usr Subtype.property, !Nat.card_zpowers, usr Set.mem_ofPred_eq, !orderOf_eq_prime,\n    orderOf_dvd_iff_pow_eq_one, #76a5]\n  [apply] grind only [usr Subtype.property, !Nat.card_zpowers, usr Set.mem_ofPred_eq, !orderOf_eq_prime,\n    orderOf_dvd_iff_pow_eq_one]\n  [apply] grind =>\n    instantiate only [#76a5, usr Subtype.property, !Nat.card_zpowers, usr Set.mem_ofPred_eq]\n    instantiate only [!orderOf_eq_prime]\n    instantiate only [orderOf_dvd_iff_pow_eq_one]",
